<fragment mode="section" requested-start="doxcnvY4tN5MNjJrGR7KKStHzFe"><h2 id="doxcnvY4tN5MNjJrGR7KKStHzFe" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.6">地址与确认订单</h2><p id="doxcnN0v7uKtzwAfqxSfWsNaHGu">对应 PRD 3.1.6。</p><h3 id="doxcneo3VZw7ph6VtlLd0bwywJe" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.6.1">前端页面</h3><grid id="doxcnxwZcSDQqteYyokEIyEJMrh"><column id="doxcnm6KAp2r7XEAm1AY6Ub50hg" width-ratio="0.500000"><p id="doxcndCHzLByfRQMInrHZ5WDngd">地址页面：用户可以查看、新增、修改、删除和设置默认收货地址。编辑表单提供“默认地址”勾选项，但业务语义为单选；勾选当前地址时页面取消其他地址的默认展示，保存请求提交set_as_default=true。保存期间按钮禁用，后端继续在事务中清除旧默认并设置当前地址，不增加额外并发锁结构。</p><p id="doxcng4x95pkm7RYymf9EuNcis7"><b>确认订单页面：</b>页面展示本次购买的商品或设计、数量、收货地址、运费和后端计算的应付金额。</p><p id="doxcnDpd91OcISowVUDuIHhRMLi">用户确认内容后提交订单，再进入微信支付流程。</p></column><column id="doxcn6o0f4ooPIcM9RPYxphvhcJ" width-ratio="0.500000"><img id="doxcnze29xJpqL4020L48SqXJ8d" name="test.jpg" caption="PRD：收货地址维护&#xA;" mime="image/jpeg" scale="0.371845" src="ONCGb1K4XoNXRPx3WTacvKBCn0c"/></column></grid><h3 id="doxcnKcyjaBylxZ37x7B9bQERwc" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.6.2">地址维护流程</h3><whiteboard id="doxcn73zmmUQqCLslqP6ymR2sSd" token="HTckwK44AhhwtEbOCotcR1KhnVf" type="mermaid">sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 用户小程序
    participant B as 业务普通云函数
    participant D as CloudBase MySQL
    U-&gt;&gt;B: 读取本人地址簿
    B-&gt;&gt;D: addresses 按可信 OpenID 且 is_deleted=0 查询
    B--&gt;&gt;U: 地址列表及默认标记
    alt 新增或修改
      U-&gt;&gt;B: 地址字段及可选地址ID
      B-&gt;&gt;D: 校验本人归属后插入或更新 addresses
    else 设为默认
      U-&gt;&gt;B: 默认地址ID
      B-&gt;&gt;D: 用户范围串行事务，清旧默认再设 is_default=1
    else 删除地址
      U-&gt;&gt;B: 地址ID
      B-&gt;&gt;D: is_deleted=1，is_default=0
    end
    B--&gt;&gt;U: 返回更新结果
    Note over U,D: 下单复制到 orders.address_snapshot；后改地址簿不影响订单</whiteboard><h4 id="doxcnjHwK500PsGI25i5qMnuyme" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.6.2.1">接口清单</h4><table id="doxcnYH7112FqsRIm7fyKHiZ6qL"><colgroup><col/><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnqH2jMt4SW65f8FlkF6P5af">云函数与 action</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnRKhKeVHZRJx5GBJTY19Fzh">调用方与身份</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnMdv8sMNz8PUVHWFec9pMkg">用途</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnN6anoEgrv8BToewLES3eze">business-api<br/>getShippingRegions</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnilNCGQAB5h43guZ0iGyVpf">用户小程序；公开读取</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcneMCehZjuxzxpAtXRyEkFse">从 site_config.shipping_rules 返回启用的省份代码、名称和展示顺序，供地址页选择可配送省份。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnb5NiaBCkh0K3cr8j0ln1Ed">business-api<br/>listAddresses</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnIVJ59ZVD8yaWWHcAKdWNle">用户小程序；可信 OpenID</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn1YtoZ4HBhQ3GNBjVwZOwFe">读取本人未删除地址。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnNrPMiPqnkTsUAW3YnvwBPh">business-api<br/>saveAddress</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnEpgNcz73XQy5yq4RwHbGjf">用户小程序；可信 OpenID</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnOv5HmHPttpiP2UG0hRVMoh">新增或修改本人地址，并校验省份当前可配送。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcncUh8u8D6nMzh0R0Kob0TTg">business-api<br/>setDefaultAddress</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnf0oDXiOG8ZXlhNMDx7OgEf">用户小程序；可信 OpenID</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn4isiOEHNR0sNSkbSfdxF8g">把指定地址设为本人唯一默认地址。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnbznUz45LG2x3TjtqTNgCub">business-api<br/>deleteAddress</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnuQoM7eo0tFHGdhPL5uQ3jh">用户小程序；可信 OpenID</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnq3F5oN6q8wKuYWZ1CJEPbg">逻辑删除本人地址。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p id="doxcnnTf4qD8rt8N27i0p0mluwb"><b>代码映射</b></p><table id="doxcnmFXc4XVkgIz9EYuHU7njbb"><colgroup><col/><col/><col/><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnFTBvXqeMNsrDUnakhrR1Nc">action</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnRX9zkcwq7eU2dCwqQrBKsc">Handler</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnojueS3afiKPnwV3ArJJDMe">Service 方法</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn1HDGlD99h5ol8fdXUrMFQd">事务</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnQ2AAWnU0SPHaHOEVtzZPfh">DAO</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnVOYZbPn2Hfar61ePM2ZDjg">getShippingRegions</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnLghf7ZwJn8xCEP0Va4aj6g">GetShippingRegionsHandler</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn31jgO3xwFGWAAbhoIZj3nX">SiteConfigService.getShippingRegions()</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnxQjeXp8YzQsoJqXgy7wOM0">否</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn8ORUe0JffkOy9YyFSBpUFg">SiteConfigDAO</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnTz1WGDJNAteHbFDql1XAzT">listAddresses</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn5DHW1BsVI0zqo3ztLju1pd">ListAddressesHandler</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnoIV3yvNUhvlhDZc7NHQeLg">AddressService.listAddresses()</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnvJrux3DUDDnijefm55FBHh">否</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnUcWruvIZYxpvQHTcU2Ap8g">AddressDAO</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnNHKuLYZhaKPpk8WcGXkN5d">saveAddress</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcntgeuCwme2D2HnbY998ZuRf">SaveAddressHandler</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnmzWNQBN8G03Y4XWyQoKTIc">AddressService.saveAddress()</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnpSgIVbPDq3Ae8NSQRmkazd">条件性</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnDkxkw7HlL2t9sRG7Szeq8b">AddressDAO、SiteConfigDAO</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnoLSd76sD9F8ZDItcv3muWd">setDefaultAddress</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnuwnyBs6y0gCjNS65KdFmIc">SetDefaultAddressHandler</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnIj8bt9G5E6WQd9lqmCqYVe">AddressService.setDefaultAddress()</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnkryl8h9cRMO0oOoydD29d7">是</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnUSgmXe2fjyrA1MdQJovT3f">AddressDAO</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn3FWwr2VLnjp7IdcagD2Cwc">deleteAddress</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnlOf8sCP3vhPS5Spv5ApMQd">DeleteAddressHandler</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnyUz0mUOugC4uoCJ2sVIWff">AddressService.deleteAddress()</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnEDefiZg5vWij5rlFZ3SVSe">否</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnUuBhZiAfotIWROTEAjQnug">AddressDAO</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h4 id="doxcnAzcMxGH3v7K7Tn50v8xs6c" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.6.2.2">getShippingRegions</h4><pre id="doxcnEM4RcrfrkPzyd2WgF9K6Kg" caption="请求&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "action": "getShippingRegions",<br/>  "payload": {}<br/>}</code></pre><pre id="doxcn3PxEG3wnW7p25QvnJKzjbR" caption="响应&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "ok": true,<br/>  "code": "OK",<br/>  "data": {<br/>    "regions": [<br/>      {"province_code": "440000", "province_name": "广东省"},<br/>      {"province_code": "310000", "province_name": "上海市"}<br/>    ]<br/>  }<br/>}</code></pre><p id="doxcn0bXSVgMCvklB49VTwfLKgb" text-indent="1">SiteConfigService 固定读取 site_config.shipping_rules.regions，只返回 enabled=true 的 province_code、province_name，并按 sort_order 排序。地址新增或修改时必须提交列表中的 province_code；后端以同一配置校验，不接受前端自由填写省份。市、区选项来自随小程序版本发布的行政区划数据，运费只按 province_code 计算。</p><h4 id="doxcnXQsticQIfKoEksjnocg9Mh" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.6.2.3">listAddresses</h4><pre id="doxcnyQKEcJoyz1WFwJqLLDwUag" caption="请求&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "action": "listAddresses",<br/>  "payload": {}<br/>}</code></pre><pre id="doxcntKKdPwPyu0n6YubxmXPB2d" caption="响应&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "ok": true,<br/>  "code": "OK",<br/>  "data": {<br/>    "addresses": [<br/>      {<br/>        "address_id": "801",<br/>        "receiver_name": "张三",<br/>        "phone": "13800000000",<br/>        "province_code": "440000",<br/>        "province": "广东省",<br/>        "city_code": "440300",<br/>        "city": "深圳市",<br/>        "district_code": "440305",<br/>        "district": "南山区",<br/>        "address_line": "示例详细地址",<br/>        "is_default": true<br/>      }<br/>    ]<br/>  }<br/>}</code></pre><p id="doxcnmNR4U2fg3BzOtIUO2OS4Ed"><b>查询条件：</b>addresses._openid=当前 OpenID、is_deleted=0；按 is_default DESC、updated_at DESC、id DESC 排序。</p><p id="doxcnv0fYvq0oOCq4rBuocAgawb" text-indent="1">地址簿向本人返回完整手机号，供编辑和下单；订单列表摘要与日志使用脱敏手机号。</p><h4 id="doxcnLzWlqRz0vXXGDywV7dmDTc" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.6.2.4">saveAddress</h4><pre id="doxcnsbOk9nJ8yFQBvcWv6SaiGd" caption="请求&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "action": "saveAddress",<br/>  "payload": {<br/>    "address_id": null,<br/>    "receiver_name": "张三",<br/>    "phone": "13800000000",<br/>    "province_code": "440000",<br/>    "city_code": "440300",<br/>    "city": "深圳市",<br/>    "district_code": "440305",<br/>    "district": "南山区",<br/>    "address_line": "示例详细地址",<br/>    "set_as_default": true<br/>  }<br/>}</code></pre><table id="doxcnFqd1vMdYfZECXlA4kINQkb"><colgroup><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnOjCtJGyVDsO7OzgsYLmgFg">字段</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnOGxMeyUm5CPzP1EK3aP5Gg">规则</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnWQuOQxbE6MTejpUq6fCogr">address_id</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnp3j4G5krdr63IrBm57PsTl">新增时为空；修改时必须属于当前 OpenID 且未删除。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnnO9HpHCEgGADixWUNJOfFe">receiver_name、phone</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnJqGRXnG7m0JtR4ukggMKce">必填；后端校验长度和基本格式，日志不得打印完整手机号。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnN7xc3DnlT1h3lbJEEMjK3c">province_code、city_code、city、district_code、district、address_line</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn6Q9rBJA6y1kO61do4i7xWe">province_code 必须命中当前启用的 shipping_rules；省份名称由后端按代码写入。市、区代码和名称来自小程序行政区划数据，详细地址必填。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn1Z5h7SqPazaVbaQCFBozwh">set_as_default</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnJIC01RFfPpQ7Q7eCVTKiCg">true 时在同一事务内清除本人原默认地址，再设置当前地址。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p id="doxcnjkm9T1y5YpEbITLeFTCLbe"><b>响应 JSON</b></p><pre id="doxcn0S5CB0W2JLgm7ploSjufPe" caption="&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "ok": true,<br/>  "code": "OK",<br/>  "data": {"address_id": "801", "is_default": true}<br/>}</code></pre><h4 id="doxcnsX0ImsYNGnaIsxAOI558mb" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.6.2.5">setDefaultAddress 与 deleteAddress</h4><pre id="doxcnr9dSCC3PdLowZEd02hCLhf" caption="设置默认地址&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "action": "setDefaultAddress",<br/>  "payload": {"address_id": "801"}<br/>}</code></pre><pre id="doxcnorCK8fZNpNJLkIQv1BPuDb" caption="删除地址&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "action": "deleteAddress",<br/>  "payload": {"address_id": "801"}<br/>}</code></pre><p id="doxcnPNEFzAtxVU1Z6NCNgUMswf"><b>后端处理步骤</b></p><ol><li id="doxcnDghIe5FJqlFVC4qfSK7HJx" seq="1" seq-marker="1. ">所有地址 ID 查询和更新都附加 _openid=当前 OpenID、is_deleted=0。</li><li id="doxcnTz1ni916FbATRZlQMhbK8g" seq-marker="2. ">设置默认地址开启事务：先将本人未删除地址 is_default 更新为 0，再把目标地址更新为 1。</li><li id="doxcneDieYVySBEMzcaFDhiswvb" seq-marker="3. ">删除地址只更新 is_deleted=1、is_default=0；不物理删除。</li><li id="doxcnw7fkfxyElymbJLe4ESnnng" seq-marker="4. ">历史 orders.address_snapshot 不读取地址簿，因此不受后续修改或删除影响。</li></ol><p id="doxcnk04tyP3b5V1ts2BxFwX5Kb"><b>错误码</b></p><table id="doxcnAxnAksDhZll9LhTJ8BBcKc"><colgroup><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcngT76bhGy7S9wy7JFjpjxBd">code</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnHyYckqyLq5AlSgMxTt83xT">触发条件</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcne0AVMTRhjy3jqaCSbbtQi5">INVALID_ARGUMENT</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnWjQZNtcQr8IoqVk7wLZW6c">姓名、电话或地址字段不符合要求。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnI7jyOb9lShB6h8VJ0zVInf">NOT_FOUND</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnCtRDfoWyz6fRaTfET9RrF5">地址不存在、已删除或不属于当前用户。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id="doxcnHziExRd4uK226sfRLlrOYb" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.6.3">订单确认与预览接口</h3><whiteboard id="doxcnCCNhoAMn7rcvxaDhOk89rc" token="VfHSwKwtbh6lTebxyBEckNtrnCc"></whiteboard><h4 id="doxcnBhDwVj4VNZAsO5G41ZbsKf" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.6.3.1">接口清单</h4><table id="doxcnsbcQXvNAQXcVsTJEo6Fccb"><colgroup><col/><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnjr85eSZn5xyfQDq61HHfMd">云函数与 action</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnt512mIERVD8vYQnKD1R9ah">调用方与身份</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnLB0g9UFIIQLFXFbtBlBGzg">用途</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnH0eNsgXX1VjXRcqcZHQCrh">business-api<br/>previewOrderFromCart</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnIoIoh1BMMLZ6XoEhWcXEhh">用户小程序；可信 OpenID</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnKxZqP1LDtiOoUJP9KfYeOf">根据本人选中的购物车条目生成可信订单预览，不写订单。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnu86oanR02W0yyDvqTmoj4e">business-api<br/>previewDirectOrder</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnvAsygnLlnfzIBlVPbREWyf">用户小程序；可信 OpenID</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcncIXFegXRDlm9FZJ1EBpJ1b">根据一个标准商品 SKU 或设计版本生成立即购买预览。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p id="doxcnbjvjpHDxXGAzvgTg7Ittkg"><b>代码映射</b></p><table id="doxcndxF5oGSFmmuzZAFxqu13jf"><colgroup><col/><col/><col/><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcni0lAlJOrkdhoYCt3qqWCbb">action / 路由</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnBWn4CbnjdXjSMTIz2bugDh">Handler / Controller</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnq3ZPqWyQMtwFjczQRNIKqf">Service</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnZc4maY6nn7HmuCrwRSRISf">UnitOfWork</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcncNfdx8QYAotHlQRoOWL50g">DAO / Client</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn0XHV5f2pdGid8JJ7aKFnDg">previewOrderFromCart</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnW7g7KaYU1XTYoK9rUJl8yI">PreviewOrderFromCartHandler</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnuINZQCakMSs5APb8v3gteC">CheckoutService</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn2Pf1NMhf8Fbgivpmx8hTkR">否</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnQp7JFMwOHZIi5CF7hkOP4g">AddressDAO、CartDAO、DesignDAO、DesignVersionDAO、CategoryDAO、CatalogItemDAO、SkuDAO、PointsAccountDAO、SkuCouponDAO</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnotASMT4dwZTWdbehXXHznd">previewDirectOrder</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnY5CxQZ1On2u0bwUHWawnWb">PreviewDirectOrderHandler</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnBICxgk965wpQeiLAc8upad">CheckoutService</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnVisREWcD5lhOfxKzyToUxc">否</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn1A4cJVuuk2t0ggJcdzxo6w">AddressDAO、DesignDAO、DesignVersionDAO、CategoryDAO、CatalogItemDAO、SkuDAO、PointsAccountDAO、SkuCouponDAO</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h4 id="doxcnTfGiBqVOoQnVjmJuzisZYb" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.6.3.2">previewOrderFromCart</h4><p id="doxcnyG3gBDTtjjJrEAwBl4JQdd"><b>请求 JSON</b></p><pre id="doxcn8G44LZnX2OghnjGLazSsQg" caption="&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "action": "previewOrderFromCart",<br/>  "payload": {<br/>    "cart_item_ids": ["7001", "7002"],<br/>    "address_id": "801"<br/>  }<br/>}</code></pre><h4 id="doxcn7t0IKY33p3QzStJL6vuT6f" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.6.3.3">previewDirectOrder</h4><pre id="doxcn26HP3wnhxnyhTwgjaxiXZe" caption="标准商品立即购买&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "action": "previewDirectOrder",<br/>  "payload": {<br/>    "item_type": "STANDARD",<br/>    "sku_id": "4001",<br/>    "design_version_id": null,<br/>    "quantity": 1,<br/>    "address_id": "801"<br/>  }<br/>}</code></pre><pre id="doxcnD46fMCucrzp3H3N5rFECZc" caption="设计版本立即购买&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "action": "previewDirectOrder",<br/>  "payload": {<br/>    "item_type": "DESIGN",<br/>    "sku_id": null,<br/>    "design_version_id": "9008",<br/>    "quantity": 1,<br/>    "address_id": "801"<br/>  }<br/>}</code></pre><p id="doxcnHsMVsdI7mccVHVcXiNY5yh"><b>统一响应 JSON</b></p><pre id="doxcnKEy1lsxbx6JeBNw2Nh5y2b" caption="&#xA;" lang="json" wrap="false"><code>{<br/>  "ok": true,<br/>  "code": "OK",<br/>  "data": {<br/>    "items": [<br/>      {<br/>        "source_type": "DESIGN",<br/>        "source_id": "9008",<br/>        "name": "绿草莓晶手串",<br/>        "quantity": 1,<br/>        "gross_amount_cent": 33850,<br/>        "discount_amount_cent": 900,<br/>        "line_amount_cent": 32950,<br/>        "purchasable": true,<br/>        "unavailable_reason": null,<br/>        "applied_sku_coupons": [<br/>          {<br/>            "sku_id": "001",<br/>            "free_quantity": 1,<br/>            "unit_price_cent": 900,<br/>            "discount_amount_cent": 900<br/>          }<br/>        ]<br/>      }<br/>    ],<br/>    "address": {<br/>      "address_id": "801",<br/>      "receiver_name": "张三",<br/>      "phone_masked": "138****0000",<br/>      "full_address": "广东省深圳市南山区示例详细地址"<br/>    },<br/>    "goods_amount_cent": 33850,<br/>    "discount_amount_cent": 900,<br/>    "shipping_fee_cent": 0,<br/>    "total_amount_cent": 32950,<br/>    "quote_hash": "服务端对结算目标、当前价格、兑换券分配和运费生成的SHA-256摘要"<br/>  }<br/>}</code></pre><p id="doxcnHQC1jn5X9ZdTujPexcFzrd"><b>后端处理步骤</b></p><ol><li id="doxcnfjQ7OEpSDgvGwP7Pi3wTgc" seq="1" seq-marker="1. ">校验 address_id 属于当前 OpenID 且未删除；响应只返回脱敏手机号。</li><li id="doxcnNJC79C9jc9i7FWrQuaSuCh" seq-marker="2. ">购物车预览：查询 id 在 cart_item_ids 中、_openid=当前 OpenID、is_deleted=0 的全部条目；返回数量必须与请求 ID 数量一致。</li><li id="doxcnumpkcag1rRhEO7F7mFA87g" seq-marker="3. ">立即购买：校验 STANDARD/DESIGN 与 sku_id/design_version_id 的互斥关系。</li><li id="doxcntx3QycK0Trdb1smsnnqdLc" seq-marker="4. ">STANDARD 读取当前分类、商品和 SKU；DESIGN 解析固定版本 components，按 sku_id 汇总材料数量并乘购买 quantity。</li><li id="doxcnpWk7EABpLnZ0PHGJd1qKzb" seq-marker="5. ">检查逻辑删除、分类启用、商品和 SKU 上架；读取当前 price_cent，计算商品合计和运费。</li><li id="doxcn3E6dlnbRFskXSp0mcRxNdd" seq-marker="6. ">预览只返回当前结果，不锁 SKU、不增加 stock_reserved、不写 orders。创建订单时必须完整重复校验。</li><li id="doxcnUUS5p0KhOgJoUkZHlZfhMc" seq="1" seq-marker="1. ">读取当前用户的 AVAILABLE user_sku_coupons，按 sku_id 汇总后在本次全部结算项目中统一分配；设计页各自显示的预计优惠不能直接相加。</li><li id="doxcndaBu5Tqihvo1ucr1II0c0d" seq-marker="2. ">PricingService 计算 goods_amount_cent、discount_amount_cent、shipping_fee_cent、total_amount_cent，并把结算目标、当前 SKU 价格、兑换券分配和运费规范化后生成 quote_hash。</li><li id="doxcniF29w9M1UzBOfKxwgOnJKh" seq-marker="3. ">预览只读，不锁定 SKU、不增加 stock_reserved、不把兑换券改为 LOCKED；创建订单时必须在事务内完整重复校验并对比 quote_hash。</li></ol><p id="doxcnnIB6yIvrSdW1nrGzTIgcnd"><b>数据库读取</b></p><table id="doxcnqNrvA8vP2BfgYBTvlPc8A1"><colgroup><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnlnhqZ7Vgpj4YkjZYsh0TMe">数据表</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnO5X0I2R8kGlvtJ58xIEzEb">用途</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn0j3xzXiSJpdanvV9pbJSZd">addresses</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnGuY0sXKS6ptxkr6zrXqaQg">校验地址归属并生成预览地址。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnk1tgP0wsmsgRkxTyvlkbuf">cart_items</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnjduep8a53OWBA38R10O0Rf">购物车预览读取本人所选条目和数量。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnS07aiHmdjQJhQDgeXkwhjg">design_versions、designs</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnSntoIVmsnXlRPbkSVpFDTf">读取本人固定设计版本及有序材料。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnuuExKMNVMlmiKh68E5Sumg">catalog_categories、catalog_items、catalog_skus</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnOgE28yXhJ1n1XMzLxWccvh">当前可购状态、价格、库存和展示资料。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p id="doxcneaC6lNiS0oKn4DyW6N1ohd"><b>错误码</b></p><table id="doxcn7vEKIuFlvMKg8sfH6TdNve"><colgroup><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnuQG6PrHbn9iRMt4Zc6UfNf">code</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn4yHnT3Y8qbLfYB1VknnoDc">触发条件</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnPKcIqKk3u095fp5Mt4GM8d">NOT_FOUND</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcntiKEPuSjqxPkADB5Ok6wGc">地址、购物车条目、SKU 或设计版本不存在。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnNunAg51KTUHynG8z0Sg4le">FORBIDDEN</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn5qMj29J2w5c288ytdpNPFb">地址、购物车条目或设计版本不属于当前用户。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn59rL6qdlKIbBa8cOyxptmb">ITEM_UNAVAILABLE</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnCA6fA6KthGBCQbwi0YyWoF">分类停用、商品/SKU 下架、材料失效。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcngWDV4UUL8ZOkmePxsZvyIb">INSUFFICIENT_STOCK</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcn00B2unuLWeKMSCajbJgk7f">当前可用库存不足；仅用于提示，创建订单仍会重新校验。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 id="doxcnLiz0UlgJqNtrOMGKXeowJb" seq="auto" seq-marker="5.6.4">前后端职责与后续接口</h3><table id="doxcnVJ35LbqNVJfdekQ6007hxd"><colgroup><col/><col/><col/></colgroup><thead><tr><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnYsCn3UWkOuVEved7Yzzh0f">组件</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnNT81W51LXNaF5ugBR6suKd">职责</p></th><th vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcneFcDY9KiG11adCLph7aIfg">不得承担的职责</p></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnHPLpvlNhgHMAAxqP6MO7lh">用户小程序</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnbY8pPqOkg0NjFuStyGQ0Ye">选择地址和购买目标；展示后端返回的数量、价格、运费和失效原因。</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnvlUxlrSXbUalO1aVXm9Khf">不能自行计算并提交可信金额，不能直接写订单或库存。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnwa3EZYVkbzAc0qdMNI5Bib">business-api 预览 action</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcntZgxwg3y4Hp9RNKNBp1Aee">校验归属与当前可购状态，按数据库数据核价并返回预览。</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnxEry5Y98JeqQ91a1YZYXld">不创建 orders，不预占库存。</p></td></tr><tr><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnn26qKzpNUgWdquVx9o6TDO">business-api 创建订单 action</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnFVddBMVcUPgTvIBGHQcU5d">用户确认后调用 createOrderFromCart 或 createDirectOrder，执行 5.7 的建单事务。</p></td><td vertical-align="top"><p id="doxcnQzCrrl74eWBBjIhrj4m7bc">不在本节重复定义支付处理。</p></td></tr></tbody></table><p id="doxcnMz489RhmJHL9YbyZr08pPc" text-indent="1">预览结果不是价格承诺。用户停留在确认页期间，商品状态、价格或库存可能变化；提交订单时以后端事务中的最新校验为准。</p></fragment>
